('SRV-73251308','kotyali-model-thana-barishal','কোতয়ালী মডেল থানা','Kowtoali Thana',NULL,40,41,'public',10004,20033,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,ARRAY['01320065826','01320065833','01320-065826']::text[],'ockotbmp@police.gov.bd','https://bmp.police.gov.bd/thana/7/kotwali-model-thana',NULL,'{"_sources": ["BARISHAL_METRO_POLICE_THANAS_2026", "BD_POLICE_CONTACTS_2020_BARISHAL"]}'::jsonb,'unverified',195,'upazila_en holds the BMP metropolitan thana (not an upazila). Name as in the BMP history page''s thana list. Phone = OC''s and duty officer''s police official mobiles (01320-06xxxx) from the BMP ''যোগাযোগ'' page; inspectors'', beat officers'' numbers and officers'' names not copied. Barishal City Corporation says it consists of ''৩টি থানা, ৩০টি ওয়ার্ড ও ২২৫টি মহল্লা'' without naming the thanas; BMP''s thana pages list (BBS 2001) BCC wards together with rural unions for Kotwali, Kaunia and Airport and only unions for Bandar, so no official source places a BMP thana wholly in the city corporation and area_en is left empty.','2026-11-12','official',195,true),
